305
00:31:58,423 --> 00:32:03,423
混沌ブギウギ ハッピーどっ森 ドンピシャシャイナ ドンピシャシャイナもだんだん
Chaos Boogie Woogie, happy forest, right on target, shiny, right on target, shiny, little by little

306
00:32:03,723 --> 00:32:08,043
落ちていく IQクソワロ 一せいのせいで 死ぬまで踊れ
Falling IQ, lmao, all together now, dance until you die!

307
00:32:19,033 --> 00:32:23,533
満身創痍 三信 神寄り どっちでもいいんだって もういいんだって
Covered in wounds, divine and godlike, either is fine, whatever is fine

308
00:32:24,133 --> 00:32:27,733
ハッピーお変わり Give me ドキめき 一せいのせいで
Happy refill, give me a heartbeat, all together now

309
00:32:27,733 --> 00:32:29,933
さあ飛び込め
Now jump right in!

310
00:32:29,933 --> 00:32:34,133
本能ブギウギ コントン どっ森 ドンピシャシャイナ ドンピシャシャイナも
Instinct Boogie Woogie, chaos, forest, right on target, shiny, right on target, shiny, too

311
00:32:34,133 --> 00:32:38,233
最低 安らぎのライカ ミステリー 一せいのせいで ぶっ飛ばすだけ
Lowest, peaceful Leica, mystery, all together now, just blow it all away!

312
00:32:39,233 --> 00:32:43,833
混沌ブギウギ ハッピーどっ森 ドンピシャシャイナ ドンピシャシャイナもだんだん
Chaos Boogie Woogie, happy forest, right on target, shiny, right on target, shiny, little by little

313
00:32:44,133 --> 00:32:48,433
落ちていく 人生 競うわの一声で 死ぬまで踊れ
Falling life, with a single shout of competition, dance until you die!

314
00:32:49,233 --> 00:32:54,233
もう嫌だ全部全部 ほら 忘れ去ってしまおう
I hate it all, everything, come on, let's just forget it all

315
00:32:54,533 --> 00:33:00,133
簡単なことじゃないが 我々ならできるだろうな
It's not a simple thing, but if it's us, we can do it, right?

316
00:33:01,233 --> 00:33:06,133
イエス イエス
Yes, yes!

317
00:33:42,874 --> 00:33:46,374
[Title: ドラマツルギー]
[Title: Dramaturgy]

318
00:33:55,334 --> 00:34:02,234
頭のなかに浮かんだ 転がるように笑った 寂しいとか愛とか分からない 人間の形は投げ出したんだ
Popped into my head, laughed like I was tumbling down, don't know what loneliness or love is, I threw away the human shape.

319
00:34:02,234 --> 00:34:07,134
抱えきれない 言葉だらけの存在証明を
Proof of existence full of words I couldn't hold onto,

320
00:34:08,134 --> 00:34:14,434
この小さな劇場から出れない 気づいたら最後逃げ出したいたい 僕ら全演技していたんだ エンドロールに向かっていくんださ
I can't get out of this small theater, if I realize it at the last minute I want to run away, we were all acting, heading towards the end roll.

321
00:34:14,934 --> 00:34:20,434
まあ皆必死に役を演じて 傍観者なんていないのさ
Well, everyone is desperately playing their roles, there are no bystanders.

322
00:34:21,134 --> 00:34:24,434
「ワタシ」なんてないの どこにだってないよ
There is no "me", it's nowhere at all.

323
00:34:24,434 --> 00:34:29,934
ずっと僕は 何者にもなれないで
I've always been unable to become anybody.

324
00:34:30,434 --> 00:34:37,434
僕ら今さぁさぁ喰らい合って 延長戦サレンダーして メーデー淡い愛想 垂れ流すことの愛想
Now, come on, let's devour each other, surrender to extra time, Mayday, faint friendliness, friendliness of letting it flow.

325
00:34:37,934 --> 00:34:42,934
ドラマチックな展開を どっか期待してんだろう
You must be expecting some dramatic development somewhere.

326
00:34:43,434 --> 00:34:46,934
君もYES YES 気を飲んで 采配はひとりきりなんだ
You too, YES YES, swallow your spirit, calling the shots all by yourself,

327
00:34:47,434 --> 00:34:52,434
ヘッドショットその思いも その心死のいってさ まだ見ぬ糸を引いて
headshot, that feeling too, that heart dying away, pulling unseen threads,

328
00:34:52,934 --> 00:34:59,934
黒幕のお出ましさ その目に映るのは
the mastermind makes an appearance, what is reflected in those eyes?

329
00:35:05,660 --> 00:35:08,610
ほら 痛いくらい待ったって 間違いなく予想通りだもん
Look, even after waiting until it hurts, it's just as expected without a doubt.

330
00:35:08,610 --> 00:35:12,780
僕全員僕でいました いつの間にか怪物になったんだ
We were all ourselves before we knew it, we became monsters.

331
00:35:12,780 --> 00:35:18,310
その全てを肯定しないと前に進めないかい
Can we not move forward unless we affirm all of that?

332
00:35:19,360 --> 00:35:26,010
まあ君にはきっと無理なんだよ だから君にはきっと無理なんだ いつの間にか野良にいたんだ
Well, it's probably impossible for you... I mean, it's probably impossible for you, and somehow we ended up out in the wild.

333
00:35:26,010 --> 00:35:31,610
皆必死に自分を守って 救いの手を待ってるのさ
Everyone is desperately protecting themselves, waiting for a helping hand.

334
00:35:31,910 --> 00:35:35,410
考えたかないよ 馬鹿になっていたいもん
I don't want to think about it, I just want to play the fool.

335
00:35:35,410 --> 00:35:40,610
ずっと僕は何者にもなれないで
I'll forever be unable to become anyone at all...

336
00:35:41,060 --> 00:35:48,760
だから今最前線に立って その頭高々舞って 劣勢だよ相棒 言語すら必要ないよ
So right now, standing on the front lines, that head soaring high, we're at a disadvantage, partner—we don't even need words.

337
00:35:48,910 --> 00:35:54,060
ドラマティックな展開をずっとそっと期待してたんだろ
You've been wishing quietly all along for a dramatic turn of events, haven't you?

338
00:35:54,060 --> 00:36:01,160
君もYES YES 息を呑んで 再会を誓いあって ワンチャンスしかないもっと一生を懸けるのさ
You too, YES YES, holding your breath, swearing to meet again, risking your whole life for this one and only chance!

339
00:36:01,310 --> 00:36:07,410
クライマックスみたいな 手に汗を握るのさ
It's like a climax, holding our breath with sweaty palms!

340
00:36:07,860 --> 00:36:13,260
ぽつりと鳴いた 音 隠してきた真実はどこにもない
A solitary crying sound... The truth we've hidden away is nowhere to be found.

341
00:36:13,260 --> 00:36:22,210
笑ってきた奴らに居場所はない 思い出してぽいってして感情はない 流した涙 理由なんてない
There's no place for the ones who laughed. Remembering, tossing it aside, devoid of emotion—the tears we shed have no reason.

342
00:36:23,060 --> 00:36:29,760
優しさに温度も感じられない 差し伸べた手に疑いしかない
We can't even feel warmth in kindness, only suspicion toward the outstretched hand.

343
00:36:29,910 --> 00:36:35,360
穴が空いて愛を垂れてしまいになったんだ 倒れそうな僕を覗き込んだんだ
A hole opened up and love started leaking out, and I peered into my own collapsing self.

344
00:36:35,860 --> 00:36:42,810
諦めかけた人の前にアンタはいつも嘲笑うようにお出ましさ
Right before someone about to give up, you always show up as if to sneer.

345
00:36:42,810 --> 00:36:49,010
君にはどんな風に見えてるんだい 呼吸を整えてさ
How does it look to you? Regulate your breathing...

346
00:36:49,260 --> 00:36:54,560
ずっと僕は何者にもなれないで
I'll forever be unable to become anyone at all...

347
00:36:54,910 --> 00:37:02,760
僕ら今さっきから暗いあって 延長戦サレンダーして メーデー淡い愛想 垂れ流しとる愛想
We've been bickering since just a moment ago, surrendering in extra time, Mayday, faint friendliness, spilling out friendliness.

348
00:37:02,810 --> 00:37:07,860
ドラマティックな展開をずっとそっと期待してたんだろ
You've been wishing quietly all along for a dramatic turn of events, haven't you?

349
00:37:07,860 --> 00:37:15,110
君もYES YES 息を呑んで 再配を仕舞いあって ヘッドショットはもう思いもその心穿ってさ
You too, YES YES, holding your breath, putting away the redeal... A headshot pierces through that memory and heart!

350
00:37:15,110 --> 00:37:21,910
まだ見ぬ糸を引いて 黒幕のお出ましさ
Pulling strings yet unseen, the mastermind makes an appearance!

351
00:37:22,210 --> 00:37:26,060
その目に映るのは
What is reflected in those eyes...

352
00:37:32,060 --> 00:37:36,560
[Sign: セレナーデ
Lyrics, Music: なとり]
[Sign: Serenade
Lyrics, Music: Natori]

353
00:37:38,060 --> 00:37:44,910
都合の良い思いを燃やして 諦めた願いはもう手放した
Burning away convenient thoughts, I've already let go of the wishes I gave up on.

354
00:37:45,060 --> 00:37:50,960
裏切りや秘密が漂って ここから動けない
Betrayal and secrets drift in the air, and I can't move from this spot.

355
00:37:51,460 --> 00:37:57,910
狂ってしまった 狂い行ってしまった あの日の場所でずっと止まったままの未来
I went crazy, drifting away, stuck forever in the future at that place from that day.

356
00:37:58,060 --> 00:38:04,910
それでも心のどこかで君を感じて 許せない今の僕は誰
Even so, somewhere in my heart I feel you—who am I right now, unable to forgive?

357
00:38:05,860 --> 00:38:14,960
ずっとずっと側にいたいんだ 勘違いだって嘘じゃないよ 望んだものじゃなくてもあなたに出逢えた
I want to stay by your side forever and ever—even if it's a misunderstanding, it's not a lie. Even if it wasn't what I wished for, I met you.

358
00:38:14,960 --> 00:38:22,460
痛みだけかいだって信じられるように 僕に触れないで 祈りセレナーデ
So that I can believe it's only pain, don't touch me—a serenade of prayer.

359
00:38:22,710 --> 00:38:29,010
僕なしでうまく幸せになってね 涙の意味もずっと 何を手放しても
Find happiness successfully without me. The meaning of tears, no matter what I let go of...

360
00:38:29,060 --> 00:38:34,860
それが愛だって信じてた 罰をください
...I believed that was love. Please give me punishment.

361
00:38:37,860 --> 00:38:49,260
罰もない あなたあなただけ 世界がまだ忘れてくれなくても きっとまだ あなたあなただけ 願い疲れても歌うよセレナーデ
Give me punishment, you, just you alone. Even if the world still won't forget, surely still, you, just you alone—even if I'm tired of wishing, I'll sing a serenade.

362
00:38:52,060 --> 00:38:57,060
願い疲れても歌うよセレナーデ
Even if I'm tired of wishing, I'll sing a serenade.

363
00:38:57,760 --> 00:39:09,560
品を踊りのコメディ 誇り気味は反面に エゴイスティックに光った瞳の中に映ってるあなたは誰 誰何が光らせた私の上だいに何も知らずにたどたどっていられたならよかった
A comedy of refined dancing, proudness on the flip side, who are you reflected in those egoistically shining eyes? Who made it shine on my stage? It would have been nice if I could have stumbled along without knowing anything.

364
00:39:10,560 --> 00:39:21,860
一番の不都合の見方だ 僕ら全員鏡だった 疑う余地もないほど 運命が定まったあの夜から僕は石を片方忘れた
We were each other's biggest inconvenience, a mirror to us all. With no room for doubt, ever since that night when fate was sealed, I forgot one of my stones.

365
00:39:24,360 --> 00:39:30,560
これだけ願って これだけ祈って どんな悲しい結末でもね
Wishing this much, praying this much, no matter how sad the ending may be...

366
00:39:31,560 --> 00:39:40,060
すべて失って すべて消え去っても ただ君がずっと生きていた 痛みが欲しい
...even if I lose everything, even if everything vanishes away, you were just living all along. I want the pain.

367
00:39:52,560 --> 00:39:59,060
後悔数えれば 後悔傷付けば 後悔失えば 後悔壊れかけ
Counting regrets, getting hurt by regrets, losing things to regrets, regrets breaking apart...

368
00:40:00,192 --> 00:40:05,252
だから僕がずっと愛していた
... That's why I had always loved...

369
00:40:05,252 --> 00:40:08,672
君よ いなくなって 祈るセレナーデ 孤独でいるより不幸合わせになってね
You, disappearing... I pray this serenade, wishing we could share our misery rather than be lonely.

370
00:40:08,672 --> 00:40:15,112
世界よりずっと 何を手放しても これが願いだって これが祈ってって こんな悲しい結末でごめんね
No matter what I let go of, more than the world itself... This is my wish, this is my prayer, I'm sorry for such a sad ending.

371
00:40:15,112 --> 00:40:19,132
全て失って 全て違っても
Even if we lose everything, even if it's all wrong...

372
00:40:19,132 --> 00:40:23,212
ただ僕がずっと 愛していた君よ
You are the one I always loved...

373
00:40:23,212 --> 00:40:29,532
いないで 祈るセレナーデ 孤独でいるより 不幸幸せになってね
Don't go, I pray this serenade, wishing we could share our misery rather than be lonely.

374
00:40:29,532 --> 00:40:36,292
誰よりもずっと 何を手放しても これが愛なんて信じてた
More than anyone, no matter what I gave up, I believed this was love.

375
00:40:36,292 --> 00:40:42,252
罰を下して 誰でもないあなた あなただけ世界
Pass down your judgment, you and no one else, you are my only world.

376
00:40:42,252 --> 00:40:52,072
まだ忘れてくれなくても きっとまだ あなた あなただけ願い 疲れても歌うよセレナーデ
Even if you still can't forget, surely you are still my only wish. Even if I grow tired, I will sing this serenade...

377
00:40:52,072 --> 00:41:04,052
雨が降り立っても 独り滲むだって 願い疲れても歌うよセレナーデ
Even if the rain falls down, even if I bleed alone, even if I grow tired of wishing, I will sing this serenade...

378
00:41:13,631 --> 00:41:16,991
クロンい！ 助けに来たよ！
Kronii! I've come to save you!

379
00:41:21,131 --> 00:41:24,051
やっぱりスバル先輩！
I knew it, Subaru-senpai!

380
00:41:24,051 --> 00:41:26,651
どうして助けが必要ってわかったんですか？
How'd ya know I needed help?

381
00:41:27,251 --> 00:41:30,651
ずっと見てたからね！
I've been watching the whole time!

382
00:41:31,151 --> 00:41:32,591
ずっと見てたんですか…？
The whole time...?

383
00:41:32,591 --> 00:41:35,891
私も？ 見てだよ
And me? I watched you.

384
00:41:36,011 --> 00:41:39,631
あぁ そうですか それは怖いけど
Oh, okay. That's scary, but...

385
00:41:39,631 --> 00:41:43,751
なんで？！ だったらもっと早く助けてほしかったですが！
Then why?! I... I wish you helped me a lot sooner then!

386
00:41:44,371 --> 00:41:58,011
途中から楽しそうにしてたから どうなるか見守ろうかなと思って！
Well, you started having fun halfway through, so I figured I'd see how things played out!

387
00:41:58,311 --> 00:42:02,671
うん 見てた… ただ世界を
Yeah. I watched... just the world.

388
00:42:03,111 --> 00:42:10,011
オッケー うん あぁ世界ね わかりました！ まあ確かに楽しんだ部分もあったかも
Okay, yeah. The world, yeah. Yeah, I mean, I guess I did end up enjoying parts of it.

389
00:42:10,291 --> 00:42:17,471
でしょ？！ だから本当に助けが必要なのかなって思ってたんだよ！
See?! That's why I was wondering whether you actually needed saving!

390
00:42:18,051 --> 00:42:24,591
あぁ 一応ありがとうございます でも本当にここから出るのを手伝ってくれるんですか？
Aw... well thank you, I guess, but can you really help me get out of here?

391
00:42:25,631 --> 00:42:39,911
あと... 待って あと1曲だけ 心を込めて歌って踊れば 家に帰れるよ！
Just... Please wait. Just one more song. If you sing and dance your heart out, you can go home!

392
00:42:40,191 --> 00:42:51,411
本当に？やった！ 世界を見てみて！ 世界！ あぁ あれが世界なんだ
Really? Yay! Just watch the world! The world! Oh, so that's the world.

393
00:42:51,911 --> 00:43:03,291
オッケー 待って ごめん 見入っちゃってた スタッフさん 下上上上上上上 そうそう！ 本当に？！
Oh, okay. Wait. Sorry. I was so fascinated. Please staff, down up up up up up up. Yeah, yeah! Really?!

394
00:43:03,971 --> 00:43:13,171
カエラも戦って歌ったあとに消えたでしょう？ あれは元の世界に帰ったからなんだよ！
Kaela disappeared after fighting and singing, right? That's because she went back to the original world.

395
00:43:13,411 --> 00:43:24,591
あぁ 戦って歌ったあとに？ 待って それって私も戦わなきゃいけないってことですか？ うん！ そう...
Oh. After fighting and singing? Wait, does that mean I have to fight too? Yep! Oh...

396
00:43:31,031 --> 00:43:39,451
わけかんない！ なんでそもそも戦わなきゃいけないの？！ 何かの儀式みたいなものだと思って！
I don't get it! Why do we have to fight at all?! Think of it like some kind of ritual!

397
00:43:40,171 --> 00:44:00,451
オッケーじゃあそこに立って攻撃を受けるだけね そして現実世界に戻ったら ご飯を作って私のこと甘やかしてもらうから！！ やめろ！お願いやめて！やめて！
Okay, then we just stand there and take the hit, and when we get back to the real world, you're going to make me food and spoil me!! Stop! Please stop stop please.

398
00:44:01,131 --> 00:44:07,511
ちょっと！ 正気なの？！ どう
YOU! Are you okay?! Are you okay?

399
00:44:07,811 --> 00:44:18,251
ちょっと待って なんでスバルがご飯作るの？！ それにさっきもう甘やかしてもらってたでしょ！
Wait, why should I cook for you? And besides, you were already getting spoiled earlier!

400
00:44:19,171 --> 00:44:24,571
とにかく！ 楽しむのが大事！ 喜びこそが鍵なんだよ！！
Anyway! You should have fun! Joy is the key!!

401
00:44:25,051 --> 00:44:32,011
ほんとかなぁ？ じゃあ楽しませてください にゃ～！
You sure about that? Then you have to entertain me. Meow!

402
00:44:32,511 --> 00:44:41,351
にゃ～？ 大丈夫...？ とにかく！
Meow? Are you okay? Anyway!

403
00:44:42,071 --> 00:44:50,611
スバ友召喚！ カモン！ スバマジで可愛い！
I summon Subatomo! Come! Subatomo is soooo cute!

404
00:44:51,191 --> 00:45:04,671
マジで可愛いでしょう？ね？ うんでも すぐろっちゃい ちっちゃい！ すぐ小さい うん！ 小さいのが可愛い！ 見るだけで幸せになるでしょ？
This is "super cute" right? Yeah, but so tiny. Tiny? It's so small. Yeah! Small is cute! Just looking at it makes you happy, right?

405
00:45:05,401 --> 00:45:07,221
ああ、おっけー。そう、これらの商品は私の周年を記念したグッズってことね。
Ah, okay. So, these are the merch celebrating my anniversary, hey?

406
00:45:07,481 --> 00:45:09,221
で、ええと、これらになにがあるんだろう？
Let's see. I wonder what they've got.

407
00:45:09,381 --> 00:45:12,221
どれも結構使えそうだから、一緒に見ていこう。
They all seem pretty useful, so let's check it out together.

408
00:45:12,561 --> 00:45:14,201
まずはバケットハット。
First up, we got a bucket hat.

409
00:45:14,821 --> 00:45:17,841
イラストははまなし先生に描いてもらいました。
The illustration was done by Hama Nashi sensei.

410
00:45:18,061 --> 00:45:21,981
コンセプトは私が……みんなの予想通り！ラスボス！
The concept is me being... you guessed it! The final boss!

411
00:45:22,161 --> 00:45:25,441
リバーシブル仕様でイラストもすごくかっこいい！
It's reversible and the artwork looks really cool!

412
00:45:25,661 --> 00:45:29,581
で、たぶんなんとなくだけど防御力も上がりそうだし。
And maybe it would make you feel like it would boost your defense stat?

413
00:45:29,861 --> 00:45:32,841
続いては、ランダム属性アクリルキーホルダー！
And next up, we got a random attribute acrylic keychain.

414
00:45:33,261 --> 00:45:36,041
ちびキャラはGurin先生に描いてもらいました。
The chibi characters were drawn by Gurin sensei.

415
00:45:36,381 --> 00:45:38,541
どれが出るか楽しみだね、えへ？
I wonder which one you'll get, eh, eh?

416
00:45:38,881 --> 00:45:41,041
そしてアクリルキーホルダーの次は――
And after the acrylic keychain, we got...

417
00:45:41,121 --> 00:45:42,541
クッションです！
a cushion!

418
00:45:42,841 --> 00:45:45,941
これもGurin先生に描いてもらいました。
The design for this was also done by Gurin sensei.

419
00:45:46,181 --> 00:45:49,361
両面にイラストが入っていて、サイズ感も使いやすいクッションです。
